# Audio is NOT redistributed through this repository.
#
# Two reasons, either of which is sufficient:
#   1. Licence. 50 of the 99 recordings are © ELLLO, licensed for classroom use
#      only — "wider redistribution is not granted". This repository is public,
#      so committing them would be redistribution. (The other 49 are VOA and are
#      public domain, but splitting the folder in half is worse than excluding it.)
#   2. Size. 273 MB of MP3 would live in the git history permanently.
#
# Every recording's source page and direct URL is recorded in
# curriculum/audio_sources.py and curriculum/audio_diagnostic.py, and
# planning/AUDIO_INDEX.md maps each one to its lesson. A teacher downloads them
# once into audio/ and everything resolves.
audio/
